        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "長い階段を下りていくと、開けた場所に辿り着いた。\n石棺がずらりと並んでいる。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e9c296c257ba20b5f9aa23f9c5900d548b7828f648d7ebde0525350f40ce20ec",
      "grid_index": 0,
